# cylinder_bore_mist.cam — the coolant menu's fixture (DECISIONS.md "coolant
# as a modeled setting…", slice 1): the K1 machine fixture's mist twin. The
# machine file adds `coolant_mist M07` to its menu, T5 declares coolant=mist,
# and the tool-change block reads `M07` where the flood twin says `M08` —
# with everything else byte-identical to cylinder_bore_machine.cam's golden.
# Strip the menu line from fanuc_mist.machine and this program REJECTS at
# validate, naming `coolant_mist` — a kind is sayable exactly when its
# machine names its word.
machine fanuc_mist.machine

units mm
feed 800
plunge 300
rapid_z 5
clearance_z 25
spindle 3000

stock Box(w=100, l=100, h=20, x=0, y=0, z=0)

tool T5 Endmill(dia=10.0, coolant=mist)

feature Bore CylinderBore(dia=40.0, extent=12.0, x=50.0, y=50.0)

run Side(tool=T5, surface=Bore, stepover=5.0)
run Side(tool=T5, surface=Bore, stepover=5.0, spindle=2400)
